 },
 "summary": "A family of nine single Schottky rectifiers in the surface-mount SMC (DO-214AB) package, rated 5 A average forward current and 120 A half-sine surge, with peak reverse voltage from 20 V (SS52C) to 200 V (SS520C). The junction carries a guard ring. Intended uses are low-voltage high-frequency inverters, freewheeling, DC/DC conversion and reverse-polarity protection. SS510C is the 100 V member: 0.85 V maximum forward drop at 5 A, 0.05 mA maximum reverse current at 25 °C, junction rated to 150 °C.",
